<title>GERMANY: German trade seeks 50,000 T intvn rye exports.</title>
<headline>German trade seeks 50,000 T intvn rye exports.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>German grain traders placed bids for the export of 50,000 tonnes of rye from intervention stores to third countries, intervention board BLE said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bids will be discussed at a weekly EU grain export tender in Brussels later today.</p>
<p>--Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
